{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-10_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-09","title":"哭声渐息","storyCode":"16-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1aedecccd5421c88097a96916682bfce403027c523ff4a757c8b9262658063eb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，您感觉，怎么样......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘀嗒、嘀嗒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嗒、嘀嗒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时钟，嘀嗒，作响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时钟，不等，任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可我们，不该唱歌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧......我们走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边没有幸存者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我好像站不起来了。利特，你还在吗？可能得有人来扶我一把——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火灭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，火早就灭了，甚至已经有幸存的村民发现我们了。我们得做些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你打算让霍里就这样一直跪在这儿吗？就算他疯了，干出这种事，处置他也没必要用这种折磨人的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火灭后四周还在持续降温，这样下去他会死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他会死。但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是现在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金望向村庄的入口。\n曾经那里是一排整齐的栅栏，只为阻挡寻找食物的牙兽而设，拦不住任何有心进入的过路人，无论他们怀有善意，还是包藏祸心。\n零落的人影开始在栅栏的残骸后出现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们颤颤巍巍地打量，而后畏缩地走开。\n雷尔金的语气几乎像是在自言自语了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我做错了事，尼克托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体是指......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍里没疯。他在火场里喊出的那些话，不是对别乔克的奶奶，也不是对他死去的儿子，而是对我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“......至此，我犯下杀戮的罪过，不为食物，不为洁净的水，不为温暖的房屋。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我只为与我同行的众人，愿他们的灵魂能得到救赎。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么也没听到。就算他说了，也不过是别乔克和她奶奶常说的那种祷告词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们信圣愚、信皇帝那套东西不是一天两天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“圣愚”？“皇帝”？没有那些虚无缥缈的东西，有的只是我逼他杀死了自己的孩子，他却仍想拯救我的灵魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这灵魂究竟是什么东西？谁又能证明它的存在？而且，它难道比在世的性命更宝贵？可笑......可笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不该逼他的，我不该，但现在最坏的结果已经酿成。如果先前他那样做是为了达成我的希望，那如今他放的这把火，目的理应相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，听我说，没有这样的道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这火也是我放的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须偿还。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，别做傻事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尽量长话短说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们还想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我们给了你们粮食和干净的水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你们的回报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你现在挡在这里，是要赶我们走，还是想继续动手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你们见证凶手得到应有的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"凶手？下场？难道你会把放火的人、杀人的人、抢劫的人全都抓出来杀死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到，否则你也不会拿着武器来跟我说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我就当你没说过吧。如果你不是想继续对我们赶尽杀绝，就离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"别再出现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金放下手中的矿镐，又卸下身上的所有武器，然后举起双手，向眼前的人示意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开，尼克托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们，也还有源石技艺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这里，我会把凶手直接交出来，任你们处置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经放下武器，我也不会使用源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以做你想做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。你是想用你自己，用一个人，包庇许多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我虽然不大会算数......却也知道这不是个划算的买卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝不反抗，我就在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不要你，我们不要你！起火时你根本不在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我要那个放了第一把火的人，我要那个趁机抢掠的人，我要那个毁了我家园的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我要那个，杀死我妻子的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使他暴力的根源在我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的自大才让队伍处于这样的困境之中，是我的逼迫才让他选择残暴的处理方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那个人，我们谁也不要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"narration","text":"废墟中清理出了一片空地，一场处决将在那里进行。\n人们不由自主地围拢过去，像围拢一团寒夜里的火，又畏惧被其温度灼伤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是不明白，霍里究竟为什么要放火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对帮助了我们的村庄，做出这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从他儿子死了之后，他就不太对劲了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，会不会——会不会其实不是他放的火？雷尔金只是想给那些人一个交代，霍里又正好病得很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识的霍里不会做这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，但我相信雷尔金。你不知道吗？他甚至已经为霍里争取过了，他想用他自己去换霍里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过还好那些村民坚持要真正的凶手，而不是一个替他受过的好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正，我不想看了，虽然还没有开始......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我要走了。我得歇一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，雷尔金要讲话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人差不多到齐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）......分担......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在杀死这个人之前，我还有几句话想说，不是为凶手辩解，也不是为了替他向受害者求得原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幸存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他该死，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他践踏了善意和信任，将所有人置于危险的境地。他违背了我们尽力活下去的初衷，伤害了无辜的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，在我们选择的道路上，死亡在所难免，但不应以这样的方式，或出于类似的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，请你们仔细看着。记住他的教训，也记住即将夺走他生命的人，正是最没有这一资格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我选择杀死他，既出于受害者的要求，也出于我自身的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这也将是我最后一次以领袖的身份做出判断。没有人应该背负杀死同伴的罪名，因此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忏悔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罪过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪在霍里肩膀上累积了厚厚一层。他像是什么也没听见一样再次跪下去，虔诚地合拢双掌，放在胸前。\n他仰头，向处决者露出脖颈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，既然我早已需要忏悔自己的罪过，那么，就由我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）很快再见，霍里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......我还以为至少能把这面镜子拼好呢，结果摔得更碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不吉利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，咱们连霍里的遗体也不能带走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们留下一具尸体根本没用啊，难道要让霍里暴尸荒野......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题在于我们没有任何谈判的资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果你们继续跟随我，很可能会得到相同的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不跟着你又要跟着谁呢？现在不是开玩笑的时候吧，雷尔金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是玩笑，这是一个决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个我刚才就说过的决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"当雷尔金转过身来，满面脏污和倦容的人群立刻像发现信标一样再度汇集到他周围，只因为他在这里。\n他们望向这个领头者，茫然地等待下一步指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还继续往南吗，雷尔金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有力气了。我只想要一个能遮挡风雪的屋檐，但这里已经连这个都没有了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续走是死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下来也是死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，我没找到他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保尔和波金娜......我没找到，连尸体也没有，对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些村民，他们不想让我靠近，我放下矿镐也不让。他们在害怕，不用眼睛看也知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想威胁他们。走吧，雷尔金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带我们走。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金的视线从每张脸上滑过，无论他们是否出声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，同伴们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的路，不会由我来为你们决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我之前说的，应该受到惩罚的并非霍里，而是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，造成了他的残暴和他的癫狂；是我一路以来做出的决定，将他逼入了这样的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这件事发生之前，我甚至没有意识到，原来不是所有人都做好了直面死亡的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实证明，我欠缺独断专行的能力，因此我能做的最后也最明智的决定，就是放弃这个做决策的位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把选择权还给你们。"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。\n长久的沉默。\n没有人回应，或者动弹哪怕一下，甚至连脸上的表情都没有一丝细微的变化。\n所有听到这个决定的人都沉默着，直到一个颤抖的声音，从人群的最末尾传出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要......抛弃......我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样的，别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，什么？刚才，你的话......还能，怎么......去理解？"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群自动为发问的人让出一条通路。\n别乔克没有上前。她站在原地，攥紧双拳，用力到指节发白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，“不决定”！在我们已经，走了......这么远的，时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是要，抛弃。你要抛弃，我们，所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有！我必须这样做，以免对大家造成更坏的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能接受再因为我专断的决策而导致无谓的人员伤亡了。我们从矿区，从那个死人地界一路逃出来不是为了这样的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“死人”......“地界”？但，那是，我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿区、矿井，是，我的......家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人，的，家。曾经是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“家”？我以为你们都是主动想要逃离的，像我一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是，因为，信任。信任你，信任——雷尔金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，你不......你不懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你们选择离开，是因为早就想要离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀死，黑虫子，站起来，说：“让我们——离开！”所以......我们，离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你抓住，霍里，杀死他，又说：“带你们，离开，是错的！”还说这是，“选择”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不——我不懂啊！我们，对你，究竟是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的友人、亲人，这太复杂了，难以定义。但正因为你们对我重要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这里，这里是那些，村民的，家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许村庄，还能，重建。可我们呢？我们又要......去、去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，带我们走了......这么远。如果现在，你不再这样，做了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们，要怎么，才能回——回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该怎么，活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。你喊我，那种语气。你又要，哄骗我。我已经，不是——我不是，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不、不反驳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的话印证了我的猜测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，我所做的一切，都只是将我的想法强加到你们身上，然后一意孤行。这使你们既不了解我的计划，也不明白那些行动隐含的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是信任我，而不是信任自己的选择。可如果我不在了呢？你们又该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我感谢你们的信任，可这样不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，现在我要把问题说清，然后让你们来做出选择。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金再次看向身前的每张面孔，确定自己已经引起了所有人的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前往乌卡边境，寻找属于感染者的农庄的确是我们的最终目标，但在过程中，我们也要让这段旅途成为乌萨斯正视我们的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题在于，这样做必定会让我们自身陷入极端的危险，因为这是在试图撼动乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经有人这样做过，而后他们销声匿迹了，只留下一个符号和一个名字，流传在这片被脏雪和沼泽覆盖的苔原上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果现在我说，跟随我可能也会步他们的后尘呢？对于任何想活下去的、理智的人来说，我都不会推荐他这样选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我甚至没给霍里选择的余地。所以，他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他让我明白，我必须把选择权交还给你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群没有回答，却在一阵模糊的喧哗后，逐渐分散开来。\n起初，差距并不显著。一些人开始站到雷尔金的身边或身后，另一些人则停在他的身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的矿工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，我们什么时候走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到所有人都做出决定，我们马上就启程。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"更多的人走向雷尔金。差距逐渐显现，那些脚步声在别乔克听来就像敲迟了的下工钟声。\n一，二，三......每数错一个，也许就多一个人被矿井吞没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁......不想，活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，非要，选？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"别乔克感觉那些人离自己越来越远。\n她想抓住些什么，无意识地往前踏出了一步，却立刻就感觉到自己被拽住，停了下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐、姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也，要过去？刚才......你在哪里？我不、不知道，该怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们......他们都要，离开！离开我们，去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系、没关系。我刚才去帮尼克托包扎伤口了，他被镜子碎片划伤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这不重要。总之，我有听到你们对话的后半段。你只是想活着，这没有任何过错，你不必强迫自己去走不认同的路，我也不会去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不——你不会？你不，离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我和我的小队会继续帮助那些伤员。而且尼克托也不会离开，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尼克托？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使分列两边，人群依旧熙攘，Raidian看不见尼克托的身影。她开始用源石技艺搜寻起特定的电信号频段，很快便找到了方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在我们的队伍后面，他不会离开——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能往回走。你知道我从圣骏堡来，矿区从来都不是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，继续往前也不一定只有死路一条。有我看着那家伙，情况也许不会像他说的那么糟糕。毕竟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机会都是由人创造的，对不对？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不、不、不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，一定要，这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......总是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......分离？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻柔的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快回去吧，别乔克，小心着凉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻柔的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等你睡着再醒来，妈妈爸爸就回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻柔的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你当个听话的乖孩子，不吵也不闹，连奶奶都夸奖......那等你醒来，枕头上就会有一块巧克力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......罢工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"争取权利......没有......响应......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......死刑......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“妈妈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“爸爸”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“孩子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......“奶奶”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一句话！只要您一句话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要一句话，我的灵魂——就会痊愈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我请求您......宽恕我......杀死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您孩子的罪孽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我愿意......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......奶奶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，有谁在......门外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无人停留，无人等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们......走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们哭着，亲吻，您的手，说，“不想分开”，却还是......分开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都有自己将行的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，这是必然？可，为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受苦的灵魂啊，你知晓原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金......还没有教、教我，怎么认......那块表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"秒表，时钟......？钟声，我听到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像往常一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，您的手......为什么，冰凉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是火滚烫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我身上，也，发凉，而且，很疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......但不是，因为......火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，人们大都如此混沌地过活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到......死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，直到死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......奶奶，您唱的，究竟......是，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我......痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为你在爱着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱，使人痛苦，使人忍耐，使人驯服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它同样使人强大，使人富有，使人高贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你爱着，所以你痛苦；我爱你，所以分担你的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"别乔克不再说话。她用力闭眼，使身体更紧地蜷缩，却不敢再触碰像往常一样抚摸着自己面颊的手。\n这些话她从前也听过，那时她不需要在支离破碎的状况中去寻找能够支撑它们的论据，但现在，她不再确定。\n明明浑噩地活着，怎么会比王公贵族更加富有和高贵呢？\n明明无能为力，又怎么会比挥舞棍棒的权威更加强大呢？\n火堆近在眼前，它本应使人温暖，别乔克却感觉凉意已经侵入四肢百骸——\n经由那只冰冷的、干枯的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我愿意默想，并分担你的痛苦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“愿我们所有人......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“都能真心忏悔所犯的罪过。”"},{"type":"narration","text":"这声音只是重复，这声音只是回声。\n这回声......指向毁灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
